From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] riched20: ITextRange Delete, SetChar, ChangeCase, CanEdit, InStory (2029)

ITextRange and ITextSelection: Delete (the range's text for a count of 0,
else counted characters from an insertion point), CanEdit, SetChar,
ChangeCase (lower, upper, title, sentence, toggle; each replaced character
keeps its formatting), InStory. Read-only controls answer E_ACCESSDENIED.
Ranges that lie wholly after deleted text now move down with it (they were
set to the start of the deletion). The test_Delete todo marks are removed.
---
